    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(6th Level)</em></p><p>You bind behavior to story roles.</p><p>Choose an archetype:</p><ul><li><p>The Betrayer</p></li><li><p>The Tyrant</p></li><li><p>The Martyr</p></li><li><p>The Fool</p></li><li><p>The Guardian</p></li><li><p>The Tempter</p></li></ul><p>The target must <em>play the role</em>:</p><ul><li><p>Hesitate</p></li><li><p>Monologue</p></li><li><p>Retreat</p></li><li><p>Confess</p></li><li><p>Overreach</p></li><li><p>Submit to a constraint</p></li></ul><h3>Cost</h3><p>Generates misfire risk if forced aggressively.</p><h3>Clarification</h3><p>This does not override free will.<br />It constrains choices within archetypal gravity.</p><p>The more resistant the target, the greater the misfire risk.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
